  "description_text": "Welcome to 23 Belle Ave here in WR! This single-family residence represents a classic architectural opportunity. Constructed in 1960, the home offers 1,148 square feet of living space, providing a foundational layout that serves as an excellent canvas for personal expression. The residence encompasses three bedrooms, offering versatile space that can be adapted to accommodate a home office, a library, or personal living quarters depending on individual requirements. The home is supported by one full bathroom, designed to provide essential functionality for the household. A 8,415-square-foot lot has many choices for investors....Further, offering significant outdoor potential rarely found within the city, while the classic 1960 construction provides a base for those looking to establish their presence in a meaningful location. We invite you to schedule a private viewing to experience the potential of this property firsthand and envision how it can serve your unique lifestyle needs.",
